{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22120","headline":"旅次华州赠袁右丞 · 白居易","name":"旅次华州赠袁右丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭水绿溶溶，华山青崇崇。\n山水一何丽，君子在其中。\n才与世会合，物随诚感通。\n德星降人福，时雨助岁功。\n化行人无讼，囹圄千日空。\n政顺气亦和，黍稷三年丰。\n客自帝城来，驱马出关东。\n爱此一郡人，如见太古风。\n方今天子心，忧人正忡忡。\n安得天下守，尽得如袁公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}